faults [meas: CtrlTest faults]: a store to STATUS, a store to program memory, a sub-word register store, a load from PTR and a misaligned load are bus errors (ERRORS [9]), div and rdcycle illegal (ERRORS [10]): each traps to the boot ROM's handler, which sends its 24 reports to C&C 1 and parks; ecall sets no bit, and meshsim stops loudly; no READY; the unit-error bit and the toast pin rise; a soft reset clears every ERRORS and the toast pin, and the tiles boot again through the ROM
invariants [meas: CtrlTest invariants]: 4 (done before arrivals), 5 (a bad packet sent), a packet in flight at a reset (gone), 8 (reply overwritten unread), 9 (unexpected arrival: its error set), a reserved register-block word (reads 0, flagged) and the table-window check each fire on a bad program
